Usage: cardano-cli dijkstra sub-transaction witness --sub-tx-file FILEPATH
                                                      --signing-key-file FILEPATH
                                                      --out-file FILEPATH
                                                      

  Create a sub-transaction key witness

Available options:
  --sub-tx-file FILEPATH   Input filepath of the JSON unsigned sub-transaction.
  --signing-key-file FILEPATH
                           Input filepath of the signing key.
  --out-file FILEPATH      The output file.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
